        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WB250, 2.5\" Concave Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Steel 2-1/2 Inch Concave Door Bumper can be used everywhere from homes to schools to retail shopping malls. This large round 2-1/2 inch wall mounted door bumper is available in 8 great finishes. and easy to install with the included hardware. The rubber bumper is concave in the center to accept the locking push button of a door knob/lever, so it will not self lock. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WB250U-specifications.gif?v=1704354528\" width=\"407\" height=\"165\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Steel 2-1/2 Inch Concave Door Bumper Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana WB250 2-1/2 Inch Wall Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WB250.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  WB250 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, it will still be durable steel material. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Steel 2-1/2 Inch Concave Door Bumper",
                "description": "2.5 Inch Concave Door Bumper, Deltana WB250 - The Steel 2-1/2 Inch Concave Door Bumper can be used everywhere from homes to schools to retail shopping malls. This large round 2-1/2 inch wall mounted door bumper is available in 8 great finishes. and easy to install with the included hardware. The rubber bumper is concave in the center to accept the locking push button of a door knob/lever, so it will not self lock. \r\n",
